. [[I]] [[am|be]] [[sorry]], goalkeeper. [[A]] [[boy]] [[from]] [[the]] [[clinic]] [[carries|carry]] [[my]] [[letters|letter]] [[now]]. [[Yours]], Mr Huy.`,`vn`:`Na th\u00e2n m\u1ebfn, \u00d4ng ph\u1ea3i n\u1eb1m y\u00ean tr\u00ean gi\u01b0\u1eddng; n\u1ebfu kh\u00f4ng, b\u00e1c s\u0129 s\u1ebd t\u1ecbch thu b\u00fat c\u1ee7a \u00f4ng. B\u1edfi v\u1eady, h\u00f4m nay \u00f4ng kh\u00f4ng sang xem tr\u1eadn \u0111\u1ea5u c\u1ee7a ch\u00e1u \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c. \u00d4ng xin l\u1ed7i nh\u00e9, c\u00f4 th\u1ee7 m\u00f4n. Gi\u1edd c\u00f3 m\u1ed9t c\u1eadu \u1edf ph\u00f2ng kh\u00e1m mang th\u01b0 gi\u00fap \u00f4ng. Th\u00e2n m\u1ebfn, \u00f4ng Huy.`},{`en`:`Na [[answered|answer]] [[the]] [[same]] [[night]], [[with]] [[four]] [[pages|page]].`,`vn`:`Ngay \u0111\u00eam h\u00f4m \u0111\u00f3 Na vi\u1ebft th\u01b0 tr\u1ea3 l\u1eddi, d\u00e0i b\u1ed1n trang.`},{`en`:`[[Dear]] Mr Huy, [[Do]] [[not]] [[be]] [[sorry]]! [[Our]] [[teacher]] [[has|have]] [[given|give]] [[us]] [[a]] [[list]] [[of]] [[big]] [[linking|link]] [[words|word]], [[and]] [[thus]] [[I]] [[am|be]] [[using|use]] [[them]] [[all]]. [[The]] [[score]] [[is|be]] [[a]] [[secret]]. Bin [[is|be]] [[happy]]; [[hence]] [[his]] [[dance]]. [[Furthermore]], [[I]] [[caught|catch]] [[nearly]] [[everything]]. [[Moreover]], Grandma [[is|be]] [[sending|send]] [[you]] [[soup]], [[plus]] [[six]] [[lemons|lemon]]. [[Additionally]], [[here]] [[is|be]] [[a]] [[drawing]] [[of]] [[your]] [[tomatoes|tomato]]. [[I]] [[water]] [[them]] [[every]] [[day]], [[whereas]] Bin [[only]] [[talks|talk]] [[to]] [[them]]. [[Besides]], [[flu]] [[cannot]] [[travel]] [[in]] an [[envelope]], [[so]] [[I]] [[will]] [[write]] [[daily]]. [[Yours]], Na.`,`vn`:`\u00d4ng Huy k\u00ednh m\u1ebfn, \u00d4ng \u0111\u1eebng xin l\u1ed7i \u1ea1! C\u00f4 gi\u00e1o v\u1eeba ph\u00e1t cho b\u1ecdn ch\u00e1u m\u1ed9t danh s\u00e1ch t\u1eeb n\u1ed1i \u0111ao to b\u00faa l\u1edbn, v\u00e0 do v\u1eady ch\u00e1u s\u1ebd d\u00f9ng b\u1eb1ng h\u1ebft. T\u1ec9 s\u1ed1 th\u00ec 